							<div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">tart frost</div><br />&nbsp;<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/smiley1.gif" alt="Smiley" border="0" /> <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/smiley1.gif" alt="Smiley" border="0" />  Don&#039;t know, just something about that make me giggle.   <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/smiley1.gif" alt="Smiley" border="0" /> <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/smiley1.gif" alt="Smiley" border="0" /><br /><br /><div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">Tips is bureau we do not raid eve litter by it sled but the wood as a woe</div><br />So is that saying that druids on raids are as good as litter and need some tips or they might as well not raid??!? <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/cwm24.gif" alt="cwm24" border="0" />
