	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg11002"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=489" title="View the profile of Revenos">Revenos</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 10<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/blank.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								An Everquest Player on Rodcet Nife<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=489"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:frank@federated.com"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1100.msg11002#msg11002"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1100.msg11002#msg11002">Re: Mods...</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #49 on:</b> September 09, 2004, 10:11:51 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Nathien, I have grouped with you. And I have been in a guild with you. Never had a problem with you. <br /><br />But, that being said, let me tell you a story -<br /><br />There was this support group which met in a psychologist&#039;s office every week. And each week, this one particular woman would tell everyone else about all of her troubles, crying through it all. One evening, while she was going on, the psychologist&#039;s dog comes into the room and goes up to each of the members and nuzzles them. And each of the members, in turn, talked kindly to the dog and petted him. Aftert about 10 minutes of this, the sobbing woman cries out, &quot;Why are you paying attention to the damned dog when my life has turned to shit?&quot; The group is somewhat stunned, until the phychologist says, &quot;Well, maybe it&#039;s because the dog let us know just exactly what it was he wanted&quot;.<br /><br />Take care, bro.<br /><br />Revenos Aurelios<br />65th Archon of Outcast Adventurers
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
