							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Revenos...The name sounds familiar...just cant put my finger on it...<br /><br />What guild were we in?<br /><br /><br /><br />...That story made alot of sense...<br /><br />I guess im just about the dumbest cockroach in the sink for taking my RL anger shit out on the mod(xors).<br /><br />Sorry Kinladar. And the other two who i cant remember how to spell...?<br /><br />----<br /><br />It&#039;s been months since i&#039;ve played...but..wait a tic, Are you a human cleric? <br /><br />I think i remember grouping with you in DL..but i was never in a guild with you...maybe im thinking of someone else..
